<title>USA: CCC seeks 13,500 T U.S. white wheat for Pakistan.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 13,500 T U.S. white wheat for Pakistan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp (CCC) of the U.S. Agriculture Department seeks 13,500 tonnes of U.S. soft white wheat, maximum moisture 13.5 percent, for donation to Pakistan.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for June 10-July 15. CCC said the wheat must be tested for vomitoxin and maximum one part per million will be accepted.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8749))</p>
</text>
